{"3035150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Welding Simulator", "steam_appid": 3035150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welding Simulator</strong> is a realistic, first-person welding simulation that allows you to learn and master various metal joining and cutting techniques. In the game, you will play the role of a welder who gains experience by performing various tasks. You will learn <strong>MMA, MIG and TIG</strong> methods, and you will be able to experiment with different materials and tools to create precise and durable structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/tig.gif?t=1759324133\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Welding Techniques</strong> – practice MMA, MIG, and TIG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting and Processing</strong> – precisely cut and adjust elements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Projects</strong> – create metal tables, bike frames, go-karts and other complex structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/szafka2.gif?t=1759324133\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop Customization</strong> – upgrade gear, organize tools, and expand your space.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode</strong> – earn money, invest in equipment, and tackle bigger challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/grind3.gif?t=1759324133\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re just starting out or looking to sharpen your technique, Welding Simulator offers a safe, accessible way to explore the craft of welding.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welding Simulator</strong> is a realistic, first-person welding simulation that allows you to learn and master various metal joining and cutting techniques. In the game, you will play the role of a welder who gains experience by performing various tasks. You will learn <strong>MMA, MIG and TIG</strong> methods, and you will be able to experiment with different materials and tools to create precise and durable structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/tig.gif?t=1759324133\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Welding Techniques</strong> – practice MMA, MIG, and TIG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting and Processing</strong> – precisely cut and adjust elements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Projects</strong> – create metal tables, bike frames, go-karts and other complex structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/szafka2.gif?t=1759324133\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop Customization</strong> – upgrade gear, organize tools, and expand your space.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode</strong> – earn money, invest in equipment, and tackle bigger challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\